&lt;/h3>&lt;p>Takahashi is learning AtCoderish Language.&lt;br>
He memorizes AtCoderish words corresponding to English words.&lt;br>
He knows that &lt;code>red&lt;/code>, &lt;code>blue&lt;/code>, and &lt;code>green&lt;/code> in English respectively correspond to &lt;code>SSS&lt;/code>, &lt;code>FFF&lt;/code>, and &lt;code>MMM&lt;/code> in AtCoderish, and he knows no other words.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>